<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>天人寿夭 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A4%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%BF%E5%A4%AD/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 11:02:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A4%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%BF%E5%A4%AD/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>天人寿夭篇第四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-04/</link><pubDate>Fri, 14 Nov 2025 15:55:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-04/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>本文通过对话深入探讨了决定人寿命长短（“寿夭”）的因素，核心观点是：&lt;strong&gt;人的先天禀赋（“天”）决定了寿命的基础，但后天的自我修养（“人”）能对其产生决定性影响。&lt;/strong&gt; 即“寿夭定于天，挽回天命者人也”。</description></item></channel></rss>